[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Hypercomputer/maxtext/pulls/5070","id":4402206734,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJDr9-M8AAAABBmRYDg","html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Hypercomputer/maxtext/pull/5070","diff_url":"https://github.com/AI-Hypercomputer/maxtext/pull/5070.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/AI-Hypercomputer/maxtext/pull/5070.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Hypercomputer/maxtext/issues/5070","number":5070,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Migrate scripts and docs from tfds pipeline to grain","user":{"login":"aireenmei","id":12836798,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODM2Nzk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12836798?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aireenmei","html_url":"https://github.com/aireenmei","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aireenmei/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aireenmei/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aireenmei/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aireenmei/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aireenmei/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aireenmei/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aireenmei/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aireenmei/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aireenmei/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# Description\r\n\r\nThis PR migrates MaxText end-to-end integration test scripts, convergence benchmarks, DiLoCo scripts, and model documentation from the legacy `tfds` dataset pipeline to `dataset_type=grain` with `grain_file_type=tfrecord`, as a follow up of #4949 \r\n\r\nThis is a prerequisite toward removing `tensorflow` and `tensorflow_datasets` dependencies in MaxText and set the default `dataset_type=synthetic` (coming PR).\r\n\r\nb/555209521\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Key Changes\r\n\r\n1. **End-to-End Test Scripts (TPU & GPU)**\r\n   - Updated integration test scripts across all model families (Llama 2/3/3.1/3.3, Gemma 1/2/3/4, GPT-OSS 20B/120B, Qwen 3/Next/MoE, DeepSeek V2, Mixtral) to use `dataset_type=grain grain_file_type=tfrecord dataset_path=${DATASET_PATH}`.\r\n   - In some cases I change from synthetic data to real data, this is to ensured consistency within multi-step test scripts so all runs requiring real training data consistently use Grain TFRecord.\r\n\r\n2. **1B Parameter Convergence Test (`test_convergence_1b_params.sh`)**\r\n   - Migrated default training data pipeline from `tfds` to `dataset_type=grain grain_file_type=tfrecord`.\r\n   - Not directly related to this feature, but makes testing easier: enabled overriding configuration parameters (`STEPS`, `EVAL_STEPS`, `EVAL_INTERVAL`, `PER_DEVICE_BATCH_SIZE`, `LOSS_THRESHOLD`, `DATASET_TYPE`) via environment variables / command-line arguments.\r\n   - Removed legacy hardcoded `LIBTPU_INIT_ARGS`, which causes`FAILED_PRECONDITION` errors on some TPU generations (e.g. TPU v5p / Viperfish).\r\n\r\n3. **Convergence Benchmarks & DiLoCo**\r\n   - Updated `benchmarks/convergence/c4_exp.py` and `benchmarks/convergence/convergence_utils.py` to propagate `grain_file_type=tfrecord` for `c4_en_hp` and `c4_mutil_hp`.\r\n   - Updated DiLoCo streaming and distributed training scripts (`scripts/diloco/run_diloco.sh`, `run_spmd_streaming_diloco.sh`, `run_spmd_streaming_dlco_moe_c4.sh`).\r\n\r\n4. **Documentation & Tutorials**\r\n   - Updated runnable command examples across model docs (`Run_Gemma3.md`, `Run_Gemma4.md`, `run_gpt_oss.md`, `Run_DeepSeek.md`, `run_qwen3_next.md`, `Run_Kimi.md`, `full_finetuning.md`) to reflect `dataset_type=grain grain_file_type=tfrecord`.\r\n\r\n5. **Cleanup of Obsolete Tests**\r\n   - Removed obsolete TFDS<->Grain input-pipeline checkpoint compatibility tests (`tests/end_to_end/test_checkpoint_compatibility.sh`, `tests/integration/checkpoint_compatibility_test.py`).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# Tests\r\n\r\n- **XPK E2E Workload Testing (TPU v5p-8 / `cloud-tpu-multipod-dev`)**:\r\n  - `conv1b`: Verified end-to-end execution of `test_convergence_1b_params.sh` with Grain TFRecord data loading and loss convergence verification. [cloud-log](https://cloudlogging.app.goo.gl/amZRDUJVQZCniHtG8)\r\n  - `gemma-e2e`: Verified checkpoint conversion, fine-tuning, and pre-training runs with Grain TFRecord. [cloud-log](https://cloudlogging.app.goo.gl/inYLFtNKwehdXT7i7). The script failed at later forward_logit_checker step for loading tokenizer, which is a pre-existing bug unrelated to this PR\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease describe how you tested this change, and include any instructions and/or\r\ncommands to reproduce.\r\n\r\n# Checklist\r\n\r\nBefore submitting this PR, please make sure (put X in square brackets):\r\n- [x] I have performed a self-review of my code. For an optional AI review, add the `gemini-review` label.\r\n- [x] I have necessary comments in my code, particularly in hard-to-understand areas.\r\n- [x] I have run end-to-end tests tests and provided workload links above if applicable.\r\n- [x] I have made or will make corresponding changes to the doc if needed, including adding new documentation pages to the relevant Table of Contents (toctree directive) as explained in [our documentation](https://maxtext.readthedocs.io/en/latest/development.html#adding-new-documentation-files).\r\n","created_at":"2026-08-31T12:18:46Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T02:59:52Z","closed_at":"2026-09-01T02:59:51Z","merged_at":"2026-09-01T02:59:51Z","merge_commit_sha":"0525c4a11533f21ac267c7ad646ee4eeed4c591b","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"xibinliu","id":1829113,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjkxMTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1829113?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xibinliu","html_url":"https://github.com/xibinliu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xibinliu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/us